flowchart TB
  E[Comment on a thread you opened or posted in, or user /ai]:::ext --> EYES[Watcher: eyes within ~10 s, replies-owed.md line]:::ext
  EYES --> K{What is it?}:::main
  K -->|instruction| FIT{Fits the line it is anchored to?}:::main
  FIT -->|no| ASK[Ask with a recommendation]:::main --> GATE
  FIT -->|yes| DO[Do it now in the PR]:::main --> RE[[Back into the PR pipeline: the reader re-reads the change, the fresh reader the final head]]:::reader --> DONE[Reply: Done in sha, what changed]:::main
  K -->|question / how about / overkill?| PIC[Whole picture: trace the flow in code]:::main --> D[Thinking agent: both sides from 3+ frames, then score and recommend]:::diverge --> SIMP{Answer is keep?}:::main
  SIMP -->|yes| BLD[Build the simpler version, name what breaks]:::main --> ANS
  SIMP -->|no| ANS[Answer: decision, code at both ends, why the other side lost]:::main
  K -->|ack: ok, lgtm| APPLY[Apply the open proposal from proposals-open.md]:::main --> DO
  K -->|review with commits| TBL[Rate each commit in a table]:::main --> ANS
  DONE --> GATE[[Posting gate]]:::gate
  ANS --> GATE
  GATE --> POST[Post, replace the owed line with done: url]:::main --> BOOK[Same step: ledger, umbrella, Decisions comment]:::main
  classDef main fill:#dbeafe,stroke:#1d4ed8,color:#0b1b3f
  classDef reader fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#15803d,color:#052e16
  classDef fresh fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#b45309,color:#3b1d02
  classDef diverge fill:#f3e8ff,stroke:#7e22ce,color:#2e1065
  classDef local fill:#ffe4e6,stroke:#be123c,color:#4c0519
  classDef gate fill:#f1f5f9,stroke:#334155,color:#0f172a,stroke-dasharray:4 3
  classDef ext fill:#ffffff,stroke:#64748b,color:#334155
